  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"ba07e0b0-5152-46e9-9761-0d0ed839789b\">\n  <figure>\n    <img src=\"/images/articles/ba07e0b0-5152-46e9-9761-0d0ed839789b-1.jpg\" alt=\"Sheet music and lyrics for Hallelujah, It Is Finished by Philip Hess and G. Koehn\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </figure>\n\n  <p>Philip and Betsy Hess live near Bethel, Pennsylvania, with their two children, Damaris and David. Philip works in dismanteling and rebuilding old barns. They attend a small, home-based fellowship, where they earnestly desire the kingdom of Christ to grow.</p>\n</article>\n",
